1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,915
Bugungi videomiz nima haqida? Yarim kunlik ishga qabul qilish usullari haqida.

2
00:00:09,915 --> 00:00:11,415
1-SAHNA: Salomlashish va oʻzini tanishtirish

3
00:00:11,415 --> 00:00:13,581
Xush kelibsiz!

4
00:00:13,604 --> 00:00:16,046
Xayrli tong!

5
00:00:16,069 --> 00:00:18,736
Xayrli tong!

6
00:00:18,759 --> 00:00:21,770
Bugundan boshlab yarim kunlik ishlaysiz, shundaymi?

7
00:00:21,794 --> 00:00:25,127
Bugundan boshlab ishlayman.

8
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,684
Iltimos, yordam bering.

9
00:00:27,707 --> 00:00:30,119
Iltimos, yordam bering.

10
00:00:30,143 --> 00:00:32,919
Ismingiz nima?

11
00:00:32,943 --> 00:00:36,343
Men Ali.

12
00:00:36,366 --> 00:00:39,185
Malayziyadan kelganman.

13
00:00:39,208 --> 00:00:41,608
Ali desangiz, shundaymi?

14
00:00:41,631 --> 00:00:44,507
Men Tanaka.

15
00:00:44,531 --> 00:00:48,418
Bu doʻkonning mudiri.

16
00:00:48,442 --> 00:00:52,290
Tanaka mudir, iltimos, yordam bering.

17
00:00:52,313 --> 00:00:55,648
Yaponiyaga qachon keldingiz?

18
00:00:55,672 --> 00:00:58,205
Oʻtgan oy keldim.

19
00:00:58,228 --> 00:01:02,428
Hozir yapon tili maktabida oʻqiyman.

20
00:01:02,451 --> 00:01:04,618
Shundaymi?

21
00:01:04,641 --> 00:01:07,841
Yapon tilini juda yaxshi bilasiz-ku!

22
00:01:07,864 --> 00:01:11,906
Yoʻq, hali yetarli emas.

23
00:01:11,930 --> 00:01:15,931
Har kuni koʻp oʻrganaman.

24
00:01:15,955 --> 00:01:19,322
Yarim kunlik ishni birinchi marta qilasizmi?

25
00:01:19,345 --> 00:01:20,994
Ha.

26
00:01:21,017 --> 00:01:24,951
Yaponiyadagi yarim kunlik ishni birinchi marta qilaman.

27
00:01:24,974 --> 00:01:28,017
Juda asabim qattiq.

28
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:30,517
Hech qisi yoq, hammaga shunday boʻladi.

29
00:01:30,541 --> 00:01:33,815
Dastlab hamma asabiylashadi.

30
00:01:33,838 --> 00:01:35,572
Ha.

31
00:01:35,595 --> 00:01:38,331
Lekin, harakat qilaman.

32
00:01:38,355 --> 00:01:42,133
Nega aynan bu doʻkonda ishlashni xohlaysiz?

33
00:01:42,156 --> 00:01:47,522
Kelajakda Yaponiyada oʻz kompaniyamni ochmoqchiman.

34
00:01:47,545 --> 00:01:53,161
Shuning uchun bu doʻkonda yapon biznesini oʻrganmoqchiman.

35
00:01:53,185 --> 00:01:56,659
Ajoyib orzu ekan!

36
00:01:56,683 --> 00:02:01,449
Bu doʻkonda turli xil ishlar bor.

37
00:02:01,472 --> 00:02:03,039
Ha.

38
00:02:03,062 --> 00:02:06,932
Koʻp ishlarni oʻrganishni xohlayman.

39
00:02:06,956 --> 00:02:11,040
Mijozlarga xizmat koʻrsatish, kassa ishlari, tovarlarni joylashtirish va boshqa ishlar bor.

40
00:02:11,063 --> 00:02:15,863
Qiyin koʻrinadi, lekin qiziqarli ham.

41
00:02:15,886 --> 00:02:17,486
Ha.

42
00:02:17,509 --> 00:02:21,985
Avvalo, quvnoq salomlashishdan boshlaymiz.

43
00:02:22,008 --> 00:02:23,707
Ha.

44
00:02:23,731 --> 00:02:26,508
Quvnoq salom beraman.

45
00:02:26,532 --> 00:02:31,798
Endi Ali uchun forma tayyorlaymiz.

46
00:02:31,821 --> 00:02:33,497
Rahmat.

47
00:02:33,521 --> 00:02:36,454
Kiyim oʻlchovingiz qanday?

48
00:02:36,477 --> 00:02:38,746
M oʻlchovmi?

49
00:02:38,769 --> 00:02:40,785
L oʻlchovmi?

50
00:02:40,809 --> 00:02:43,778
L oʻlchovni iltimos qilaman.

51
00:02:43,801 --> 00:02:45,801
Tushunarli.

52
00:02:45,824 --> 00:02:48,105
Bu yerga keling.

53
00:02:48,129 --> 00:02:49,562
Ha.

54
00:02:49,585 --> 00:02:51,718
Kechirasiz.

55
00:02:51,741 --> 00:03:00,750
Bugungi videoning ssenariysi tavsif va eng yuqori sharhdan yuklab olinishi mumkin.

56
00:03:00,750 --> 00:03:02,250
2-SAHNA: Xodimlar xonasidan foydalanish

57
00:03:02,250 --> 00:03:06,650
Alixon, bu xodimlar uchun dam olish xonasi.

58
00:03:06,673 --> 00:03:09,907
Ha, shu dam olish xonasi ekan.

59
00:03:09,930 --> 00:03:14,580
Ha. Yuklaringizni shu yerda, javonga qo'ying.

60
00:03:14,603 --> 00:03:16,536
Tushunarli.

61
00:03:16,559 --> 00:03:19,526
Ana o'sha ko'k javonmi?

62
00:03:19,549 --> 00:03:23,168
Yo'q, u ko'k javon emas.

63
00:03:23,191 --> 00:03:25,625
Yonidagi oq javon.

64
00:03:25,648 --> 00:03:29,528
A, ana o'sha oq javon ekan.

65
00:03:29,551 --> 00:03:31,805
Tushunarli.

66
00:03:31,829 --> 00:03:36,429
Kalit bor, qimmatbaho narsalaringizni sumkangizga solib qo'ying.

67
00:03:36,452 --> 00:03:40,509
Ha, sumkaga solib qo'ydim.

68
00:03:40,532 --> 00:03:43,384
Bu kalit kimniki?

69
00:03:43,407 --> 00:03:46,289
U mening kalitim.

70
00:03:46,313 --> 00:03:49,088
Uni tegmang, iltimos.

71
00:03:49,111 --> 00:03:52,278
Kechirasiz, tushundim.

72
00:03:52,301 --> 00:03:55,039
Alixon, bu sizning kalitingiz.

73
00:03:55,063 --> 00:03:56,902
Buni ishlating.

74
00:03:56,926 --> 00:03:58,659
Rahmat.

75
00:03:58,682 --> 00:04:01,493
Bu mening kalitim ekan.

76
00:04:01,517 --> 00:04:05,083
Ha. Yo'qotmang, iltimos.

77
00:04:05,106 --> 00:04:07,673
Ha, e'tibor beraman.

78
00:04:07,696 --> 00:04:11,296
Keyin, bu sizning formangiz.

79
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:15,092
Vov, juda chiroyli forma ekan!

80
00:04:15,116 --> 00:04:17,282
Shlyapa ham bor.

81
00:04:17,305 --> 00:04:19,182
Buni ham kiyib oling.

82
00:04:19,205 --> 00:04:22,572
Ha, shlyapani ham kiyaman.

83
00:04:22,595 --> 00:04:25,873
Bu qayerda kiyinishim kerak?

84
00:04:25,897 --> 00:04:28,464
Kiyinish uchun ana u yerda xona bor.

85
00:04:28,487 --> 00:04:31,053
Ana u yer kiyinish xonasi.

86
00:04:31,076 --> 00:04:32,743
Tushunarli.

87
00:04:32,766 --> 00:04:35,432
Ana o'sha eshik ortidagi xonami?

88
00:04:35,455 --> 00:04:38,022
Ha, shunday.

89
00:04:38,045 --> 00:04:40,055
Ism belgisi ham bor.

90
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:42,612
Bu sizning ism belgigiz.

91
00:04:42,635 --> 00:04:44,438
Rahmat.

92
00:04:44,462 --> 00:04:47,337
Ism belgisini qayerga taqish kerak?

93
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:51,493
Ism belgisini kiyimingizning chap tomoniga taqing.

94
00:04:51,516 --> 00:04:53,794
Kiyimning chap tomoniga, shundaymi?

95
00:04:53,818 --> 00:04:58,351
Aytgancha, bu poyabzal kimniki?

96
00:04:58,374 --> 00:05:01,374
U katta xodimning poyabzali.

97
00:05:01,397 --> 00:05:04,364
Alixon, sizning poyabzalingiz shu yerda.

98
00:05:04,387 --> 00:05:07,387
A, mana bu yerda ekan.

99
00:05:07,410 --> 00:05:09,376
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

100
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:11,411
Tayyormisiz?

101
00:05:11,435 --> 00:05:14,435
Ha, kiyinib kelaman.

102
00:05:14,458 --> 00:05:21,563
Bugungi videodagi ma'lumotlarni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif qismida va eng yuqori kommentda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan o'chirilishi mumkin.

103
00:05:21,563 --> 00:05:23,063
3-SAHNA: Yarim stavka ishlash bo'yicha tushuntirish

104
00:05:23,063 --> 00:05:28,063
Alixon, bu forma sizga juda mos tushdi!

105
00:05:28,086 --> 00:05:29,935
Rahmat.

106
00:05:29,958 --> 00:05:32,891
Biroz uyalaman.

107
00:05:32,914 --> 00:05:37,847
Endi, do'kon qoidalarini va jadvalni tushuntiraman.

108
00:05:37,870 --> 00:05:40,004
Ha, iltimos.

109
00:05:40,027 --> 00:05:47,793
Alixonning yarim stavka ishlashi har hafta dushanba, chorshanba va juma kunlari.

110
00:05:47,816 --> 00:05:51,950
Dushanba, chorshanba, juma kunlari, shundaymi?

111
00:05:51,973 --> 00:05:53,810
Tushunarli.

112
00:05:53,833 --> 00:05:59,474
Ish vaqti: kechqurun soat 4 dan kecha soat 9 gacha.

113
00:05:59,497 --> 00:06:01,977
4 dan 9 gacha, shundaymi?

114
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:06,842
Ha, iltimos, soat toʻrtga besh daqiqa qolganda doʻkonga keling.

115
00:06:06,866 --> 00:06:09,558
Toʻrtga besh daqiqa qolganda, shundaymi?

116
00:06:09,581 --> 00:06:12,148
Kechikmayman.

117
00:06:12,171 --> 00:06:14,626
Ajoyib!

118
00:06:14,649 --> 00:06:17,662
Tanaffus vaqti bormi?

119
00:06:17,685 --> 00:06:22,918
Qancha vaqt ishlashdan keyin tanaffus olamiz?

120
00:06:22,941 --> 00:06:29,024
Bu doʻkonda besh soat ishlashdan keyin 30 daqiqa tanaffus bor.

121
00:06:29,048 --> 00:06:32,688
30 daqiqa tanaffus, shundaymi?

122
00:06:32,711 --> 00:06:35,391
Tanaffus soati nechada?

123
00:06:35,415 --> 00:06:38,451
Kunga qarab farq qiladi.

124
00:06:38,475 --> 00:06:42,445
Odatda soat olti yoki yetti atrofida.

125
00:06:42,468 --> 00:06:44,235
Tushunarli.

126
00:06:44,258 --> 00:06:47,991
Tanaffus vaqtida ham maosh beradimi?

127
00:06:48,014 --> 00:06:52,492
Yoʻq, tanaffus vaqtida maosh berilmaydi.

128
00:06:52,515 --> 00:06:54,764
Tushunarli.

129
00:06:54,788 --> 00:06:57,322
Soatbay necha pul?

130
00:06:57,345 --> 00:07:01,078
Soatbay 1200 yen.

131
00:07:01,101 --> 00:07:03,793
1200 yenmi?

132
00:07:03,817 --> 00:07:05,983
Yaxshi pul ekan!

133
00:07:06,006 --> 00:07:08,075
Xursand boʻldim!

134
00:07:08,099 --> 00:07:12,434
Maosh berish kuni har oy 25-kuni.

135
00:07:12,458 --> 00:07:16,191
Bank hisobingizga oʻtkazamiz.

136
00:07:16,214 --> 00:07:18,481
25-kun, shundaymi?

137
00:07:18,504 --> 00:07:21,984
Mening hisobim Mizuho bankida.

138
00:07:22,007 --> 00:07:23,879
Tushunarli.

139
00:07:23,902 --> 00:07:26,985
Keyinroq hujjatlarni toʻldirib bering.

140
00:07:27,009 --> 00:07:28,642
Ha.

141
00:07:28,665 --> 00:07:30,754
Bugun toʻldiraman.

142
00:07:30,777 --> 00:07:33,777
Savolingiz bormi?

143
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:36,371
Qoʻshimcha ish (overtime) bormi?

144
00:07:36,395 --> 00:07:40,362
Asosan qoʻshimcha ish boʻlmaydi.

145
00:07:40,385 --> 00:07:43,868
Vaqti kelganda ketishingiz mumkin.

146
00:07:43,891 --> 00:07:45,658
Yaxshi boʻldi, xotirjam boʻldim.

147
00:07:45,681 --> 00:07:48,418
Rahmat.

148
00:07:48,441 --> 00:07:49,941
4-SAHNA: Doʻkonning omborxona qismi bilan tanishtirish

149
00:07:49,941 --> 00:07:54,032
Bugun avval omborxonani koʻrsataman.

150
00:07:54,056 --> 00:07:56,499
Omborxona, shundaymi?

151
00:07:56,522 --> 00:07:59,522
Bu yer keng ekan!

152
00:07:59,545 --> 00:08:01,112
Ha.

153
00:08:01,135 --> 00:08:05,135
Bu yerda koʻp mahsulotlar bor.

154
00:08:05,158 --> 00:08:09,424
U yerda koʻp ichimliklar turibdi-ku!

155
00:08:09,448 --> 00:08:11,681
Ha, shunday.

156
00:08:11,704 --> 00:08:16,319
U yer sovuq ichimliklar ombori.

157
00:08:16,342 --> 00:08:20,309
Issiq ichimliklar qayerda?

158
00:08:20,332 --> 00:08:27,765
Issiq ichimliklar ana u yerda kichik qutida turibdi.

159
00:08:27,788 --> 00:08:30,859
A, ana oʻsha qutida ekan!

160
00:08:30,882 --> 00:08:33,016
Tushunarli.

161
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:37,519
Keyin, axlat qutilarining joyini tushuntiraman.

162
00:08:37,543 --> 00:08:40,815
Axlat qutisi qayerda?

163
00:08:40,839 --> 00:08:46,258
Ana u yerda qora axlat qutisi bor.

164
00:08:46,282 --> 00:08:48,348
Ha, shunday.

165
00:08:48,371 --> 00:08:52,654
Lekin u yonadigan axlat uchun.

166
00:08:52,678 --> 00:08:57,090
Plastik butilka (PET) axlat qutisi qayerda?

167
00:08:57,113 --> 00:09:03,113
Plastik butilka axlat qutisi uning yonida.

168
00:09:03,136 --> 00:09:06,936
A, bu oq axlat qutisi ekan!

169
00:09:06,959 --> 00:09:08,559
Ha.

170
00:09:08,582 --> 00:09:13,760
Yaponiyada axlatni ajratish juda muhim.

171
00:09:13,784 --> 00:09:15,350
Ha.

172
00:09:15,373 --> 00:09:19,783
Malayziyaga qaraganda qattiqroq, shuning uchun ehtiyot boʻlaman.

173
00:09:19,807 --> 00:09:25,007
Shuningdek, ana u yerda qaychi va ruchkalar bor.

174
00:09:25,030 --> 00:09:27,463
Lenta ham bormi?

175
00:09:27,486 --> 00:09:32,133
Ha, lenta ham ana u javoning ustida.

176
00:09:32,157 --> 00:09:34,031
Tushunarli.

177
00:09:34,054 --> 00:09:37,188
Ishda ishlatiladigan asboblar ekan.

178
00:09:37,211 --> 00:09:39,477
Ha, shunday.

179
00:09:39,500 --> 00:09:44,307
Ishlatgandan keyin albatta asl joyiga qaytarib qoʻying.

180
00:09:44,330 --> 00:09:48,297
Asl joyiga qaytarib qoʻyaman.

181
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:52,955
Keyin, ana u yerda turgan mashinaga qarang.

182
00:09:52,979 --> 00:09:56,745
U katta mashina nima?

183
00:09:56,768 --> 00:10:01,102
U xavfsizlik kamerasining monitori.

184
00:10:01,125 --> 00:10:05,392
Doʻkonda koʻp kameralar bor.

185
00:10:05,415 --> 00:10:08,874
Vaa, koʻp ekan-ku!

186
00:10:08,898 --> 00:10:12,098
Xavfsizlik uchun muhim narsa.

187
00:10:12,121 --> 00:10:16,172
Ha, toʻgʻri.

188
00:10:16,195 --> 00:10:20,595
Endi doʻkon ichiga kiramiz.

189
00:10:20,619 --> 00:10:23,819
Ha, boramiz.

190
00:10:23,842 --> 00:10:25,342
5-Sahna: Mijozlarga xizmat koʻrsatish asoslari / Mijozlarga tabassum va salomlashish

191
00:10:25,342 --> 00:10:29,709
Ali, bu yer doʻkonning savdo maydoni.

192
00:10:29,732 --> 00:10:30,732
Ha.

193
00:10:30,755 --> 00:10:34,488
Koʻp mijozlar kelgan ekan.

194
00:10:34,511 --> 00:10:39,783
Mijozlarga xizmat koʻrsatishda eng muhim narsa nima deb oʻylaysiz?

195
00:10:39,806 --> 00:10:43,940
Hmm, albatta tabassum kerak.

196
00:10:43,963 --> 00:10:46,563
Toʻgʻri javob!

197
00:10:46,586 --> 00:10:51,552
Tabassum va baland ovozda salomlashish juda muhim.

198
00:10:51,575 --> 00:10:52,909
Ha.

199
00:10:52,932 --> 00:10:56,065
Salomlashishni mashq qilishni xohlayman.

200
00:10:56,088 --> 00:10:59,580
Endi, menga taqlid qilib koʻring.

201
00:10:59,603 --> 00:11:01,578
Xush kelibsiz!

202
00:11:01,602 --> 00:11:03,970
Xush kelibsiz!

203
00:11:03,993 --> 00:11:05,760
Yaxshi.

204
00:11:05,783 --> 00:11:10,584
Biroz balandroq ovozda iltimos.

205
00:11:10,608 --> 00:11:12,851
Xush kelibsiz!

206
00:11:12,874 --> 00:11:15,010
Ajoyib!

207
00:11:15,034 --> 00:11:19,367
Keyin, hisob-kitob paytidagi salomlashish.

208
00:11:19,390 --> 00:11:21,123
Rahmat.

209
00:11:21,146 --> 00:11:22,780
Rahmat.

210
00:11:22,803 --> 00:11:26,877
Ovozingiz juda chiroyli va ajoyib.

211
00:11:26,900 --> 00:11:28,900
Rahmat.

212
00:11:28,923 --> 00:11:31,021
Xursand boʻldim!

213
00:11:31,045 --> 00:11:35,650
Mijoz doʻkonga kirganda nima deyish kerak?

214
00:11:35,673 --> 00:11:39,273
'Xush kelibsiz!' deyish kerak.

215
00:11:39,296 --> 00:11:43,535
Mijoz doʻkonni tark etayotganda nima deyish kerak?

216
00:11:43,558 --> 00:11:46,292
'Rahmat!' deyish kerak.

217
00:11:46,315 --> 00:11:48,395
Juda yaxshi bajardingiz.

218
00:11:48,418 --> 00:11:51,352
Salomlashishingiz mukammal.

219
00:11:51,375 --> 00:11:53,408
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

220
00:11:53,431 --> 00:11:56,031
Biroz ishonchim ortdi.

221
00:11:56,054 --> 00:12:02,821
Mijoz nimadir izlayotganida 'Nimadir izlayapsizmi?' deyish kerak.

222
00:12:02,844 --> 00:12:05,377
Nimadir izlayapsizmi?

223
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:09,090
Qiyin, lekin yodlayman.

224
00:12:09,114 --> 00:12:12,364
Shoshilmang, asta-sekin.

225
00:12:12,388 --> 00:12:14,721
Biroz-biroz yodlab boramiz.

226
00:12:14,744 --> 00:12:16,077
Ha.

227
00:12:16,100 --> 00:12:19,786
Har kuni baland ovozda salomlashaman.

228
00:12:19,809 --> 00:12:24,876
Ali, sizning yorqin ovozingiz doʻkonni quvnoq qiladi.

229
00:12:24,900 --> 00:12:26,593
Rahmat.

230
00:12:26,616 --> 00:12:28,788
Harakat qilaman.

231
00:12:28,812 --> 00:12:30,312
6-Sahna: Kassa ishlatish / Kassani qanday ishlatish

232
00:12:30,312 --> 00:12:34,520
Endi kassadagi ishni oʻrgataman.

233
00:12:34,543 --> 00:12:38,809
Ha, biroz asabiy boʻlsam ham, sinab koʻrmoqchiman.

234
00:12:38,832 --> 00:12:41,432
Bu kassaning ekrani.

235
00:12:41,455 --> 00:12:44,463
Ekran sensorli.

236
00:12:44,487 --> 00:12:47,738
Ekran katta va yaxshi koʻrinib turibdi.

237
00:12:47,761 --> 00:12:51,094
Mahsulotda shtrix-kod mavjud.

238
00:12:51,117 --> 00:12:54,951
Iltimos, bu apparat bilan shtrix-kodni o‘qing.

239
00:12:54,974 --> 00:12:58,041
“Piiit” deb tovush chiqadi, shundaymi?

240
00:12:58,064 --> 00:13:04,431
Ha, tovush eshitilganda ekranga mahsulot nomi va narxi chiqadi.

241
00:13:04,454 --> 00:13:10,338
A, ekranga “onigiri 150 yen” deb chiqdi.

242
00:13:10,361 --> 00:13:12,331
Ha, shunday.

243
00:13:12,354 --> 00:13:17,887
Barcha shtrix-kodlarni o‘qib bo‘lgach, bu “Jami” tugmasini bosing.

244
00:13:17,910 --> 00:13:20,510
“Jami” tugmasi, shundaymi?

245
00:13:20,533 --> 00:13:22,167
Bosdim.

246
00:13:22,190 --> 00:13:25,991
Keyin, mijozga qancha pul to‘lash kerakligini ayting.

247
00:13:26,014 --> 00:13:29,547
“150 yen”, deb ayting.

248
00:13:29,570 --> 00:13:32,104
150 yen.

249
00:13:32,127 --> 00:13:34,860
Mijoz 1000 yen berdi.

250
00:13:34,883 --> 00:13:39,381
Ekranga 1000 deb kiriting.

251
00:13:39,404 --> 00:13:41,404
1, 0, 0, 0, shundaymi?

252
00:13:41,427 --> 00:13:43,164
Kiritdim.

253
00:13:43,188 --> 00:13:47,832
Keyin, bu “Joriy hisob” tugmasini bosing.

254
00:13:47,855 --> 00:13:49,255
Bosdim.

255
00:13:49,278 --> 00:13:52,512
A, kassa ochildi!

256
00:13:52,535 --> 00:13:54,901
Qaytim qancha?

257
00:13:54,924 --> 00:13:57,561
Ekranga qarang.

258
00:13:57,585 --> 00:14:03,119
Ekranda “Qaytim: 850 yen” deb yozilgan.

259
00:14:03,142 --> 00:14:06,908
850 yenni mijozga bering.

260
00:14:06,931 --> 00:14:10,989
Qaytimni banknot va tangalarini sanab chiqaring.

261
00:14:11,012 --> 00:14:18,812
500 yenlik tanga 1 ta, 100 yenlik tanga 3 ta, 50 yenlik tanga 1 ta.

262
00:14:18,835 --> 00:14:20,670
Toʻgʻri javob!

263
00:14:20,694 --> 00:14:25,261
Qabul qilingan summa va qaytimni adashtirmang!

264
00:14:25,284 --> 00:14:26,817
Ha.

265
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:29,280
Raqamlarni yaxshi ko‘rib chiqing.

266
00:14:29,304 --> 00:14:30,804
7-SAHNA: KASSADA TO‘LOVNI TASDIQLASH ASOSLARI

267
00:14:30,804 --> 00:14:34,970
Ali, kassadagi ishlaring qanday?

268
00:14:34,993 --> 00:14:38,442
O‘rganganimdan keyin biroz o‘rganganday bo‘ldim.

269
00:14:38,466 --> 00:14:43,269
Lekin ba’zida shoshilaman.

270
00:14:43,293 --> 00:14:46,097
Hech qisi yoq, hammaga shunday boʻladi.

271
00:14:46,121 --> 00:14:51,587
Bugun to‘lovni tasdiqlashni o‘rganamiz.

272
00:14:51,610 --> 00:14:54,810
Ha, iltimos.

273
00:14:54,833 --> 00:15:01,200
Mijoz kassaga kelganda avvalo mahsulotlarni o‘qiymiz, to‘g‘rimi?

274
00:15:01,223 --> 00:15:05,693
Ha, bu ishni bajara olaman.

275
00:15:05,717 --> 00:15:11,483
Keyin, mijozga to‘lov usulini so‘raymiz.

276
00:15:11,506 --> 00:15:14,440
To‘lov usuli deb?

277
00:15:14,463 --> 00:15:18,200
Ha.

278
00:15:18,223 --> 00:15:20,226
“Naqd pulmi, karta bilanmi?” deb so‘rang.

279
00:15:20,249 --> 00:15:22,183
To‘lov naqd pulmi yoki karta bilanmi?

280
00:15:22,206 --> 00:15:25,819
Yaxshi.

281
00:15:25,842 --> 00:15:27,851
Yaqinda smartfon orqali to‘lov ham ko‘p bo‘ladi.

282
00:15:27,875 --> 00:15:29,716
Smartfon bilan qanday qilish kerak?

283
00:15:29,739 --> 00:15:34,226
Smartfondagi shtrix-kodni kassa apparati bilan o‘qiymiz.

284
00:15:34,250 --> 00:15:38,017
Bu naqd pul bilan bir xilmi yoki karta bilan bir xilmi?

285
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:44,082
Karta bilan bir xil tugmani bosing.

286
00:15:44,106 --> 00:15:46,639
Ekranda “Shtrix-kod orqali to‘lov” tugmasini bosing.

287
00:15:46,662 --> 00:15:49,629
Bu naqd pul bilan bir xilmi yoki karta bilan bir xilmi?

288
00:15:49,652 --> 00:15:53,452
Karta bilan bir xil tugmani bosing.

289
00:15:53,475 --> 00:15:58,516
Ekranda “Shtrix-kod orqali to‘lov” tugmasini bosing.

290
00:15:58,539 --> 00:16:02,473
“Shtrix-kod orqali to‘lov” tugmasi, shundaymi?

291
00:16:02,496 --> 00:16:04,662
Tushunarli.

292
00:16:04,685 --> 00:16:11,019
Mijoz karta chiqarganda, uni shu yerga kiritishini so‘rang.

293
00:16:11,042 --> 00:16:15,208
Mijoz o‘zi kiritadimi?

294
00:16:15,231 --> 00:16:17,842
Ha, o‘zi kiritadi.

295
00:16:17,866 --> 00:16:20,466
Biz ularni tegmaymiz.

296
00:16:20,489 --> 00:16:22,322
Tushunarli.

297
00:16:22,345 --> 00:16:24,712
Bu xavfsiz ekan.

298
00:16:24,735 --> 00:16:29,401
To‘lov tugagach, chekni mijozga bering.

299
00:16:29,424 --> 00:16:32,191
Чипта керакми, деб сўрагангиз маъқул.

300
00:16:32,214 --> 00:16:34,032
Чипта керакми?

301
00:16:34,056 --> 00:16:37,139
Ha.

302
00:16:37,162 --> 00:16:42,296
Чипта керак эмас, деган мижозлар ҳам кўп.

303
00:16:42,319 --> 00:16:44,085
Tushunarli.

304
00:16:44,108 --> 00:16:46,917
Илтифот билан сўрайсиз.

305
00:16:46,941 --> 00:16:48,441
8-сахна: Обедларни қabul qilish / Ошхона хизмати (бэнто буюртмалари)

306
00:16:48,441 --> 00:16:54,450
Алижон, бугун биз обедларни қabul қилиш ҳақида гапирамиз.

307
00:16:54,473 --> 00:16:57,073
Обедларни қabul қилиш ҳақидами?

308
00:16:57,096 --> 00:16:59,769
Нима дейиш керак?

309
00:16:59,793 --> 00:17:03,041
Обедни иситиб беришим керакми?

310
00:17:03,065 --> 00:17:04,631
деб сўрайсиз.

311
00:17:04,654 --> 00:17:08,096
Обедни иситиб беришим керакми?

312
00:17:08,120 --> 00:17:15,087
Мижоз «ҳа» деса, микротўлқинли печкага қўясиз.

313
00:17:15,110 --> 00:17:18,476
Микротўлқинли печканинг вақти қандай?

314
00:17:18,499 --> 00:17:22,554
Обед пакетида вақт кўрсатилган.

315
00:17:22,578 --> 00:17:29,073
50 сония ёки 1 дақиқача.

316
00:17:29,097 --> 00:17:30,730
Ha.

317
00:17:30,754 --> 00:17:35,687
Бу иш учун мўлжалланган печка, тугмасини бир марта босиш кифоя.

318
00:17:35,710 --> 00:17:37,644
Қулай экани!

319
00:17:37,667 --> 00:17:40,933
Иситгандан кейин нима қиламиз?

320
00:17:40,956 --> 00:17:46,556
Иссиқ обедларни совуқ ичимликлар билан бирга қўймаймиз.

321
00:17:46,579 --> 00:17:49,746
Алоҳида пакетларга соламизми?

322
00:17:49,769 --> 00:17:52,040
Ha, shunday.

323
00:17:52,064 --> 00:17:55,297
Алоҳида пакетларга солиш яхшироқ.

324
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:57,087
Tushunarli.

325
00:17:57,110 --> 00:17:59,002
Эътибор бераман.

326
00:17:59,026 --> 00:18:02,793
Кейин пакетни текшириш.

327
00:18:02,816 --> 00:18:05,155
Пакет керакми?

328
00:18:05,178 --> 00:18:06,945
деб сўрайсиз.

329
00:18:06,968 --> 00:18:09,135
Пакет керакми?

330
00:18:09,158 --> 00:18:17,024
Ҳозирда пакет пулли. Катта пакет 5 сўм, кичик пакет 3 сўм.

331
00:18:17,047 --> 00:18:19,581
Пакет пулли экан.

332
00:18:19,604 --> 00:18:21,937
Пул тушади.

333
00:18:21,960 --> 00:18:23,960
Ha, shunday.

334
00:18:23,983 --> 00:18:30,116
Мижоз пакет керак деса, пакет тугмасини босасиз.

335
00:18:30,139 --> 00:18:31,940
Tushunarli.

336
00:18:31,963 --> 00:18:36,096
Обедлар учун хам қошиқча бериладими?

337
00:18:36,119 --> 00:18:37,494
Ha.

338
00:18:37,518 --> 00:18:40,157
Қошиқча керакми?

339
00:18:40,180 --> 00:18:42,025
деб сўрагангиз маъқул.

340
00:18:42,049 --> 00:18:44,616
Қошиқча керакми?

341
00:18:44,639 --> 00:18:47,494
Қошиқ ҳам керакми?

342
00:18:47,517 --> 00:18:51,751
Каре ёки дориада қошиқ берилади.

343
00:18:51,774 --> 00:18:55,907
Маҳсулотга қараб, қошиқча ёки қошиқни танлайсиз.

344
00:18:55,930 --> 00:18:57,430
9-сахна: Ошиқча танлаш / Ошиқча танлаш

345
00:18:57,430 --> 00:18:59,397
Xush kelibsiz!

346
00:18:59,420 --> 00:19:01,557
Xush kelibsiz!

347
00:19:01,581 --> 00:19:06,548
Ай, мижоз, бирор нарса излаяпсизми?

348
00:19:06,571 --> 00:19:08,740
Кечирасиз.

349
00:19:08,764 --> 00:19:11,764
Ошиқча сотиб олмоқчиман.

350
00:19:11,787 --> 00:19:14,787
Қайси бири мазали?

351
00:19:14,810 --> 00:19:19,576
Бу дўконда жуда кўп ошиқчалар бор.

352
00:19:19,599 --> 00:19:23,633
Энг кўп сотиладиган ошиқча қайси?

353
00:19:23,656 --> 00:19:28,193
Илвасинли ошиқча энг кўп сотилади.

354
00:19:28,217 --> 00:19:30,693
Жуда мазали.

355
00:19:30,716 --> 00:19:32,806
Илвасими?

356
00:19:32,830 --> 00:19:34,996
Yaxshi.

357
00:19:35,019 --> 00:19:38,253
Бошкаси нима бор?

358
00:19:38,276 --> 00:19:42,565
Олча, комбу ва туна-майонез бор.

359
00:19:42,588 --> 00:19:45,421
Туна-майонез мазалими?

360
00:19:45,444 --> 00:19:47,278
Ha.

361
00:19:47,301 --> 00:19:52,956
Туна-майонез илвасидан кейин энг кўп сотилади.

362
00:19:52,980 --> 00:19:55,413
Ёшлар орасида кўп қизиқилади.

363
00:19:55,436 --> 00:19:58,836
Мен майонезни яхши кўраман.

364
00:19:58,859 --> 00:20:01,526
Туна-майонезни олай.

365
00:20:01,548 --> 00:20:03,588
Rahmat.

366
00:20:03,612 --> 00:20:06,269
Bu yerda tuna mayonez bor.

367
00:20:06,293 --> 00:20:09,972
Achchiq onigiri bormi?

368
00:20:09,995 --> 00:20:13,929
Mentayko onigiri bir oz achchiqroq.

369
00:20:13,952 --> 00:20:15,952
Mentaykoni?

370
00:20:15,975 --> 00:20:18,645
U ham juda mazali koʻrinadi.

371
00:20:18,668 --> 00:20:23,082
Mentayko bilan tuna mayonez, qaysi birini tanlaysiz?

372
00:20:23,106 --> 00:20:26,072
Bugun tuna mayonezni tanlayman.

373
00:20:26,095 --> 00:20:28,187
Tushunarli.

374
00:20:28,211 --> 00:20:29,944
Rahmat.

375
00:20:29,967 --> 00:20:32,934
Toʻlovni shu yerda qilib qoʻying.

376
00:20:32,957 --> 00:20:34,647
Ha.

377
00:20:34,671 --> 00:20:37,007
Sumka kerak emas.

378
00:20:37,030 --> 00:20:39,697
Sumka kerak emas, shundaymi?

379
00:20:39,720 --> 00:20:41,787
Rahmat.

380
00:20:41,810 --> 00:20:43,777
Yuz ellik yen.

381
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:45,047
Ha.

382
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:47,804
Yuz ellik yen.

383
00:20:47,827 --> 00:20:50,193
Aynan shuncha miqdorni olaman.

384
00:20:50,216 --> 00:20:52,074
Rahmat.

385
00:20:52,097 --> 00:20:54,166
Rahmat.

386
00:20:54,190 --> 00:20:55,690
10-SAHNA: Xizmat koʻrsatish va sigaret raqamlari

387
00:20:55,690 --> 00:21:01,870
Ali, sizning oldingi xizmat koʻrsatishingiz juda yaxshi boʻldi.

388
00:21:01,893 --> 00:21:03,512
Rahmat.

389
00:21:03,535 --> 00:21:07,702
Onigiri haqidagi tushuntirishingiz qiziqarli edi.

390
00:21:07,725 --> 00:21:12,858
Kassaning yonida sigaret javoni bor, shundaymi?

391
00:21:12,881 --> 00:21:16,895
Ha, juda koʻp sigaretlar bor.

392
00:21:16,919 --> 00:21:22,174
Sigaretlarni mijozlar oʻzi olmaydi.

393
00:21:22,197 --> 00:21:25,274
Biz olamizmi?

394
00:21:25,298 --> 00:21:30,236
Ha, har bir sigaretning raqami bor.

395
00:21:30,259 --> 00:21:33,926
1-raqamdan 100-raqamgacha bor.

396
00:21:33,948 --> 00:21:37,951
Mijoz raqamni aytadimi?

397
00:21:37,975 --> 00:21:43,575
Ha, masalan, „5-raqamli sigaretni bering“ deb aytadi.

398
00:21:43,598 --> 00:21:45,931
Beshinchi raqam, shundaymi?

399
00:21:45,954 --> 00:21:49,087
Izlash qiyin koʻrinadi.

400
00:21:49,110 --> 00:21:55,969
Raqamlar chapdan tartib bilan joylashgan, shuning uchun tez topiladi.

401
00:21:55,992 --> 00:21:57,992
Tushunarli.

402
00:21:58,015 --> 00:22:00,501
Vaqti-vaqti bilan izlayman.

403
00:22:00,525 --> 00:22:05,564
Sigaret sotishda yana bir muhim narsa bor.

404
00:22:05,587 --> 00:22:07,554
Nima?

405
00:22:07,578 --> 00:22:10,857
Yoshni tekshirish.

406
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:16,370
Yaponiyada sigaretni 20 yoshdan boshlab sotib olish mumkin.

407
00:22:16,394 --> 00:22:18,372
Yigirma yosh, shundaymi?

408
00:22:18,395 --> 00:22:21,462
Malayziyadan ham farq qiladi.

409
00:22:21,485 --> 00:22:27,698
Mijoz yosh koʻrinsa, ekrandagi tasdiqlash tugmasini bosishini soʻraymiz.

410
00:22:27,721 --> 00:22:32,521
„Ekrandagi tugmani bosing“ deb aytamizmi?

411
00:22:32,544 --> 00:22:35,311
Ha, o‘zi kiritadi.

412
00:22:35,334 --> 00:22:39,934
„Iltimos, ekranga teging“ deb ayting.

413
00:22:39,957 --> 00:22:43,334
Iltimos, ekranga teging.

414
00:22:43,358 --> 00:22:45,758
Ajoyib!

415
00:22:45,781 --> 00:22:49,876
Bu qonun, shuning uchun juda muhim.

416
00:22:49,900 --> 00:22:51,733
Ha.

417
00:22:51,756 --> 00:22:54,249
Hech qachon unutmayman.

418
00:22:54,273 --> 00:22:55,773
11-SAHNA: Issiq gazaklar bilan ishlash

419
00:22:55,773 --> 00:23:02,740
Ali, keyingi ish – kassa yonidagi issiq gazaklar.

420
00:23:02,763 --> 00:23:06,829
Ha, tovuq va kroketlar.

421
00:23:06,852 --> 00:23:09,019
Ha, shunday.

422
00:23:09,042 --> 00:23:17,642
Mijoz „Tovuq bering“ deb aytganda, qisqich bilan sumkaga solamiz.

423
00:23:17,665 --> 00:23:21,282
Ha, qisqichdan foydalanamiz.

424
00:23:21,305 --> 00:23:27,114
Shuningdek, mijozga „Sous kerakmi?“ deb soʻrashni unutmang.

425
00:23:27,137 --> 00:23:30,032
„Sous kerakmi?“ deb soʻrashni unutmang.

426
00:23:30,056 --> 00:23:34,489
Ha, „Sous kerakmi?“ deb soʻraymiz.

427
00:23:34,512 --> 00:23:36,479
деб сўрайсиз.

428
00:23:36,502 --> 00:23:41,469
Hozir tovuq sotib olsa, sous bepul.

429
00:23:41,492 --> 00:23:44,466
Ha, bepul.

430
00:23:44,489 --> 00:23:46,522
Tushunarli.

431
00:23:46,545 --> 00:23:52,401
Tovuq juda mashhur, tugab qolsa, darhol qovurib qoʻying.

432
00:23:52,424 --> 00:23:55,858
Ha, darhol qovuraman.

433
00:23:55,881 --> 00:24:00,847
U yerda, qovurish uchun „frayer“ deb ataladigan mashina bor.

434
00:24:00,870 --> 00:24:03,204
Ana oʻsha mashina, shundaymi?

435
00:24:03,227 --> 00:24:09,260
Ha, yogʻi qizigan, ehtiyot boʻling.

436
00:24:09,283 --> 00:24:13,650
Ha, juda ehtiyot boʻlaman.

437
00:24:13,673 --> 00:24:15,362
Rahmat.

438
00:24:15,385 --> 00:24:19,399
Ishni puxtalik bilan bajarish juda muhim.

439
00:24:19,423 --> 00:24:22,590
Ha, harakat qilaman.

440
00:24:22,612 --> 00:24:26,946
Kareli non va kroketlar ham yaxshi sotiladi.

441
00:24:26,969 --> 00:24:30,302
Kareli non va kroketlar, shundaymi?

442
00:24:30,325 --> 00:24:32,815
Koʻp tayyorlayman.

443
00:24:32,839 --> 00:24:38,972
Mijoz buyurtma bersa, mahsulotni adashtirmang.

444
00:24:38,995 --> 00:24:42,228
Ha, tekshirib qoʻyaman.

445
00:24:42,251 --> 00:24:44,619
Hech qisi yoq, hammaga shunday boʻladi.

446
00:24:44,643 --> 00:24:48,125
Ali, siz allaqachon oʻrganib oldingiz-ku.

447
00:24:48,148 --> 00:24:51,148
Ha, rahmat.

448
00:24:51,171 --> 00:24:54,910
Issiq gazaklar bilan ishlash qiziqarli.

449
00:24:54,933 --> 00:25:00,029
Endi qovurishni mashq qilamiz.

450
00:25:00,053 --> 00:25:02,819
Ha, iltimos.

451
00:25:02,842 --> 00:25:07,289
Yogʻ harorati 180 daraja.

452
00:25:07,313 --> 00:25:11,368
Ha, 180 daraja.

453
00:25:11,392 --> 00:25:13,397
Eslab qolaman.

454
00:25:13,421 --> 00:25:14,921
12-SAHNA: Bento xizmatida xashak va qoshiqni tekshirish

455
00:25:14,921 --> 00:25:22,087
Ali, bento xizmatida mijozlarga xashak va qoshiq kerakligini soʻraymiz.

456
00:25:22,110 --> 00:25:25,944
Ha, xashak va qoshiq.

457
00:25:25,967 --> 00:25:28,200
Ha, shunday.

458
00:25:28,223 --> 00:25:35,037
Bento olmoqchi boʻlgan mijozlarga „Xashak kerakmi?“ deb soʻrang.

459
00:25:35,060 --> 00:25:39,951
Ha, „Xashak kerakmi?“ deb soʻrayman.

460
00:25:39,974 --> 00:25:46,058
Kare yoki doriya boʻlsa, „Qoshiq kerakmi?“ deb soʻrang.

461
00:25:46,082 --> 00:25:51,657
Ha, „Qoshiq kerakmi?“ deb soʻrayman.

462
00:25:51,680 --> 00:25:53,949
Ha, shunday.

463
00:25:53,973 --> 00:25:59,173
Bento paketiga bitta xashak soling.

464
00:25:59,196 --> 00:26:02,648
Ha, bitta solaman.

465
00:26:02,671 --> 00:26:06,271
Lagʻmon uchun esa yogʻoch xashak yaxshi.

466
00:26:06,294 --> 00:26:08,567
Yogʻoch xashak, shundaymi?

467
00:26:08,591 --> 00:26:10,725
Tushunarli.

468
00:26:10,748 --> 00:26:16,581
Mijoz ikki kishi boʻlsa, ikkita xashak soling.

469
00:26:16,604 --> 00:26:19,872
Ha, ikkita solaman.

470
00:26:19,895 --> 00:26:25,062
Baʼzi mijozlarga xashak kerak boʻlmaydi.

471
00:26:25,085 --> 00:26:28,983
Ha, oʻsha paytda nima qilaman?

472
00:26:29,007 --> 00:26:34,613
„Xashak kerak emas“, deyilsa, solmang.

473
00:26:34,636 --> 00:26:38,040
Ha, solmaslik kerak.

474
00:26:38,064 --> 00:26:42,231
Koʻpincha unutib qoʻyiladi, shuning uchun ehtiyot boʻling.

475
00:26:42,254 --> 00:26:45,420
Ha, ehtiyot boʻlaman.

476
00:26:45,443 --> 00:26:49,541
Band vaqtda unutib qoʻyish mumkin.

477
00:26:49,565 --> 00:26:53,498
Ha, tinchlik bilan paketga solaman.

478
00:26:53,521 --> 00:26:56,460
Juda yaxshi bajardingiz.

479
00:26:56,483 --> 00:27:01,960
Xashakni unutib qoʻysangiz, mijoz qiynaladi.

480
00:27:01,984 --> 00:27:04,759
Ha, juda muhim.

481
00:27:04,782 --> 00:27:09,949
Xashak bilan birga nam salfetkalarni ham unutmang.

482
00:27:09,972 --> 00:27:13,270
Ha, nam salfetkalarni ham solaman.

483
00:27:13,293 --> 00:27:15,728
Tayyormisiz?

484
00:27:15,752 --> 00:27:18,886
Ha, tayyorman.

485
00:27:18,909 --> 00:27:22,509
Endi mashqni boshlaymiz.

486
00:27:22,532 --> 00:27:26,265
Ha, iltimos.

487
00:27:26,288 --> 00:27:27,788
13-Sahna: Tovarlarni javonlarga joylash / Javonlarni tovarlar bilan to'ldirish asoslari

488
00:27:27,788 --> 00:27:33,438
Ali, endi sizga tovarlarni javonlarga joylashni o‘rgataman.

489
00:27:33,461 --> 00:27:36,428
Ha, javonlarga joylash.

490
00:27:36,451 --> 00:27:42,460
Yuk mashinasidan kelgan tovarlarni do‘kon javonlariga joylashtiramiz.

491
00:27:42,483 --> 00:27:45,516
Ha, joylashtiramiz.

492
00:27:45,539 --> 00:27:50,273
Yaroqlilik muddati yaqinda tugaydiganlarini orqaga qo‘ying.

493
00:27:50,296 --> 00:27:54,376
Ha, yaqinda tugaydiganlarini orqaga.

494
00:27:54,399 --> 00:27:56,604
Ha, shunday.

495
00:27:56,627 --> 00:27:59,604
Eski tovarlar sotilishi uchun shunday qilamiz.

496
00:27:59,627 --> 00:28:02,296
Ha, tushunarli.

497
00:28:02,320 --> 00:28:06,653
Tovar nomlarini yaxshi ko‘rib chiqing.

498
00:28:06,676 --> 00:28:09,610
Ha, nomlariga qarayman.

499
00:28:09,633 --> 00:28:13,199
Onigirilar eng past javonda bo‘ladi.

500
00:28:13,222 --> 00:28:16,831
Ha, eng past javonda.

501
00:28:16,855 --> 00:28:19,989
Ichimliklar esa yuqori javonda.

502
00:28:20,012 --> 00:28:23,012
Ha, yuqori javonda.

503
00:28:23,035 --> 00:28:27,269
Ko‘p bo‘lsa, ko‘proq joylashtiring.

504
00:28:27,292 --> 00:28:30,773
Ha, chiroyli joylashtiraman.

505
00:28:30,797 --> 00:28:34,664
Mijozlar qulay sotib olishlari uchun joylashtiramiz.

506
00:28:34,687 --> 00:28:37,320
Ha, tushunarli.

507
00:28:37,343 --> 00:28:41,110
Iltimos, u yerda non javonlarini ham tekshiring.

508
00:28:41,133 --> 00:28:43,466
Ha, non javonlari.

509
00:28:43,489 --> 00:28:45,556
Hozir boraman.

510
00:28:45,579 --> 00:28:47,265
Rahmat.

511
00:28:47,288 --> 00:28:50,055
Qo‘lingiz tez ekan.

512
00:28:50,078 --> 00:28:52,175
Rahmat.

513
00:28:52,198 --> 00:28:56,365
Band vaqt bo‘lgani uchun tezroq qiling.

514
00:28:56,388 --> 00:28:59,156
Tez joylashtiraman.

515
00:28:59,179 --> 00:29:03,212
Tovarlar tushib ketmasligi uchun ehtiyot bo‘ling.

516
00:29:03,235 --> 00:29:06,202
Ehtiyot bo‘lib joylashtiraman.

517
00:29:06,225 --> 00:29:09,358
Javonlarni to‘ldirish muhim ish.

518
00:29:09,381 --> 00:29:12,781
Ha, harakat qilaman.

519
00:29:12,804 --> 00:29:14,304
14-Sahna: Yaroqlilik muddatini tekshirish / Yaroqlilik muddatini tekshirish

520
00:29:14,304 --> 00:29:20,072
Ali, bugungi obentolarning yaroqlilik muddatini tekshiring.

521
00:29:20,096 --> 00:29:23,696
Ha, yaroqlilik muddati.

522
00:29:23,719 --> 00:29:28,088
U yerda sovutgichdagi obentolarni ko‘rib chiqing.

523
00:29:28,111 --> 00:29:32,551
Ha, obentolarni ko‘raman.

524
00:29:32,575 --> 00:29:37,775
Bugun soat o‘nlik muddati tugaydigan obentolar bormi?

525
00:29:37,798 --> 00:29:42,806
Ha, soat o‘nlik muddati tugaydiganlari uchta bor.

526
00:29:42,829 --> 00:29:47,719
Ular tez orada muddati tugayapti, olib tashlang.

527
00:29:47,742 --> 00:29:51,557
Ha, olib tashlayman.

528
00:29:51,580 --> 00:29:55,947
Muddati o‘tgan obentolarni sotish mumkin emas.

529
00:29:55,970 --> 00:30:00,303
Ha, sotish mumkin emas.

530
00:30:00,326 --> 00:30:03,944
Afsuski, bu qoida, lekin kerak.

531
00:30:03,968 --> 00:30:07,535
Ha, tushunarli.

532
00:30:07,558 --> 00:30:11,191
Sovutgichdagi barcha obentolarni tekshiring.

533
00:30:11,214 --> 00:30:14,898
Ha, hammasini ko‘raman.

534
00:30:14,922 --> 00:30:18,289
Muddati ertaga qadarmi?

535
00:30:18,312 --> 00:30:20,172
Bugungacha bo‘lganlari ham bormi?

536
00:30:20,195 --> 00:30:24,961
Bugungacha bo‘lgan obentolar bor.

537
00:30:24,984 --> 00:30:28,657
Ularni eng oldinga qo‘ying.

538
00:30:28,681 --> 00:30:32,959
Ha, eng oldinga qo‘yaman.

539
00:30:32,983 --> 00:30:36,864
Mijozlar darhol xarid qila olishlari uchun harakat qilamiz.

540
00:30:36,888 --> 00:30:40,127
Ha, xarid qilish qulay boʻladi.

541
00:30:40,151 --> 00:30:44,884
Yaroqlilik muddati yaqinlashgan mahsulotlarga stiker yopishtiring.

542
00:30:44,907 --> 00:30:48,307
Ha, stiker yopishtiraman.

543
00:30:48,330 --> 00:30:51,502
Chegirma stikerlarini yopishtiramiz.

544
00:30:51,525 --> 00:30:55,492
Ha, chegirma stikerlari.

545
00:30:55,515 --> 00:30:58,115
Juda yaxshi bajardingiz.

546
00:30:58,138 --> 00:31:02,105
Yaroqlilik muddati juda muhim.

547
00:31:02,128 --> 00:31:06,977
Ha, har kuni albatta tekshiraman.

548
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:08,934
Rahmat.

549
00:31:08,957 --> 00:31:11,957
Ha, harakat qilaman.

550
00:31:11,980 --> 00:31:14,467
Iltimos, yordam bering.

551
00:31:14,490 --> 00:31:19,057
Ha, ishonchingiz komil boʻlsin.

552
00:31:19,080 --> 00:31:20,580
15-SAHNA: Doʻkon tozalash darsi / Doʻkonni tozalash saboqlari

553
00:31:20,580 --> 00:31:26,013
Ali, doʻkon polini tozalang.

554
00:31:26,036 --> 00:31:29,003
Ha, tozalayman.

555
00:31:29,026 --> 00:31:32,492
U yerda turgan mopdan foydalaning.

556
00:31:32,515 --> 00:31:35,849
Ha, mop.

557
00:31:35,872 --> 00:31:41,105
Mijozlar koʻp, shuning uchun ehtiyot boʻling.

558
00:31:41,128 --> 00:31:44,695
Ha, ehtiyot boʻlaman.

559
00:31:44,718 --> 00:31:48,084
Kirish joyi ifloslangan.

560
00:31:48,107 --> 00:31:52,127
Ha, kirish joyini tozalayman.

561
00:31:52,150 --> 00:31:58,162
Doʻkonning kirish joyi muhim, shuning uchun toza tuting.

562
00:31:58,186 --> 00:32:01,245
Ha, toza qilaman.

563
00:32:01,268 --> 00:32:05,525
Yomgʻirli kunlarda ayniqsa ifloslanishi mumkin.

564
00:32:05,549 --> 00:32:08,549
Ha, yomgʻir yogʻyapti.

565
00:32:08,572 --> 00:32:13,106
Bugun yomgʻir yogʻyapti, shuning uchun tez ifloslanadi.

566
00:32:13,129 --> 00:32:15,218
Ha, shunday.

567
00:32:15,241 --> 00:32:18,041
Bir necha marta tozalang.

568
00:32:18,064 --> 00:32:22,398
Ha, bir necha marta tozalayman.

569
00:32:22,420 --> 00:32:26,387
Doʻkonning tozaligi eng muhim.

570
00:32:26,410 --> 00:32:30,043
Ha, tozalik muhim.

571
00:32:30,066 --> 00:32:32,670
Juda muhim.

572
00:32:32,694 --> 00:32:37,227
Mijozlar qulay xarid qila olishlari uchun harakat qilamiz.

573
00:32:37,250 --> 00:32:42,055
Ha, qulay xarid qilishni xohlaymiz.

574
00:32:42,078 --> 00:32:45,845
Mopdan qanday foydalanishni bilasizmi?

575
00:32:45,868 --> 00:32:49,148
Ha, bilaman.

576
00:32:49,171 --> 00:32:52,305
Detergentdan ozroq ishlating.

577
00:32:52,328 --> 00:32:56,624
Ha, detergent ishlataman.

578
00:32:56,648 --> 00:33:01,781
Pol sirgʻalib ketmasligi uchun ehtiyot boʻling.

579
00:33:01,804 --> 00:33:05,676
Ha, sirgʻalib ketmasligi uchun harakat qilaman.

580
00:33:05,700 --> 00:33:09,667
Tozalagandan soʻng, mopni yuvib qoʻying.

581
00:33:09,690 --> 00:33:13,623
Ha, mopni yuvaman.

582
00:33:13,646 --> 00:33:15,379
Rahmat.

583
00:33:15,402 --> 00:33:17,736
Ishonib topshirdim.

584
00:33:17,759 --> 00:33:21,175
Ha, toza qilaman.

585
00:33:21,199 --> 00:33:23,638
Ishonch bilan topshiring.

586
00:33:23,661 --> 00:33:25,161
16-SAHNA: Hojatxona tozalash asoslari / Hojatxonani tozalashning asosiy qoidalari

587
00:33:25,161 --> 00:33:29,294
Ali, hojatxona ifloslangan.

588
00:33:29,317 --> 00:33:32,287
Ha, darhol tozalayman.

589
00:33:32,311 --> 00:33:36,244
Hojatxona tozalash asboblari u yerda.

590
00:33:36,267 --> 00:33:39,234
Ha, u yerda ekan.

591
00:33:39,256 --> 00:33:41,990
Qoʻlqop kiying.

592
00:33:42,013 --> 00:33:45,346
Ha, qoʻlqop kiyaman.

593
00:33:45,369 --> 00:33:50,336
Hojatxonaga mijozlar eng koʻp e’tibor berishi mumkin.

594
00:33:50,359 --> 00:33:53,959
Ha, juda muhim joy.

595
00:33:53,982 --> 00:33:58,448
Detergent bilan toza artib qoʻying.

596
00:33:58,471 --> 00:34:01,871
Ha, toza artaman.

597
00:34:01,894 --> 00:34:05,628
Polni ham artib tashlang, unutmang.

598
00:34:05,651 --> 00:34:08,547
Ha, polni ham artaman.

599
00:34:08,570 --> 00:34:11,570
Hidga ham e’tibor bering.

600
00:34:11,593 --> 00:34:15,193
Ha, xushboʻy hid taratuvchi qoʻyaman.

601
00:34:15,216 --> 00:34:16,906
Rahmat.

602
00:34:16,930 --> 00:34:18,897
Katta yordam boʻldi.

603
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:22,187
Yoʻq, bu mening yarim stavkali ish joyim.

604
00:34:22,210 --> 00:34:25,578
Hojatxona tozalash qiyin ish ekan, shundaymi?

605
00:34:25,601 --> 00:34:30,176
Ha, lekin toza boʻlganda juda yaxshi his qiladi.

606
00:34:30,200 --> 00:34:32,038
Ha, shunday.

607
00:34:32,061 --> 00:34:35,400
Mijozlar uchun harakat qilaylik.

608
00:34:35,424 --> 00:34:38,591
Ha, harakat qilaman.

609
00:34:38,614 --> 00:34:41,580
Tugatganingizda menga aytib qoʻying.

610
00:34:41,603 --> 00:34:45,137
Ha, tugatganimda xabar beraman.

611
00:34:45,160 --> 00:34:48,410
Qoʻllaringizni yaxshi yuvib oling.

612
00:34:48,434 --> 00:34:51,450
Ha, yaxshi yuvaman.

613
00:34:51,473 --> 00:34:53,506
Rahmat.

614
00:34:53,529 --> 00:34:56,734
Ha, tez orada tugataman.

615
00:34:56,758 --> 00:34:59,053
Iltimos, yordam bering.

616
00:34:59,076 --> 00:35:02,544
Ha, toza qilib tozalab kelaman.

617
00:35:02,568 --> 00:35:04,068
17-SAHNA: Zaxira tekshiruvi va tovarlar bilan toʻldirish / Inventoryani tekshirish va toʻldirish

618
00:35:04,068 --> 00:35:08,684
Ali, javonda tovar yoʻq ekan.

619
00:35:08,708 --> 00:35:11,179
Ha, sotilib ketgan.

620
00:35:11,202 --> 00:35:15,571
Qayerdadir boʻlishi mumkin, qidirib koʻring.

621
00:35:15,595 --> 00:35:18,169
Ha, qidiraman.

622
00:35:18,193 --> 00:35:21,206
Orqa omborni qidirib koʻrdingizmi?

623
00:35:21,229 --> 00:35:23,862
Yoʻq, hali emas.

624
00:35:23,885 --> 00:35:26,085
Hozir qidiraman.

625
00:35:26,108 --> 00:35:28,075
Rahmat.

626
00:35:28,098 --> 00:35:30,754
Koʻp sotilgan ekan, shundaymi?

627
00:35:30,778 --> 00:35:34,660
Ha, juda bandmiz.

628
00:35:34,683 --> 00:35:38,216
Agar zaxirada boʻlsa, darhol joylashtiring.

629
00:35:38,239 --> 00:35:41,322
Ha, darhol joylashtiraman.

630
00:35:41,346 --> 00:35:45,603
Agar zaxirada boʻlmasa, menga xabar bering.

631
00:35:45,627 --> 00:35:49,794
Ha, zaxirada boʻlmasa, xabar beraman.

632
00:35:49,817 --> 00:35:51,250
Iltimos qilaman.

633
00:35:51,273 --> 00:35:55,326
Bu tovar juda mashhur ekan.

634
00:35:55,349 --> 00:35:58,442
Ha, men ham yoqadi.

635
00:35:58,466 --> 00:36:01,633
Mijozlar izlayotgan boʻlishi mumkin.

636
00:36:01,656 --> 00:36:05,733
Ha, izlab kelishlari mumkin.

637
00:36:05,757 --> 00:36:08,242
Tez topilsa yaxshi boʻlardi.

638
00:36:08,265 --> 00:36:11,798
Ha, harakat qilib qidiraman.

639
00:36:11,821 --> 00:36:16,459
Orqa ombor tartibga solingan, shuning uchun topish oson.

640
00:36:16,482 --> 00:36:19,682
Ha, topish oson ekan.

641
00:36:19,705 --> 00:36:21,581
Rahmat.

642
00:36:21,604 --> 00:36:25,004
Ha, tez qaytaman.

643
00:36:25,027 --> 00:36:27,194
Iltimos qilaman.

644
00:36:27,217 --> 00:36:29,684
Ha, borib kelaman.

645
00:36:29,707 --> 00:36:32,273
Tez qidirib kelaman.

646
00:36:32,296 --> 00:36:33,796
18-SAHNA: Birinchi ish haqi / Birinchi oylik maosh

647
00:36:33,796 --> 00:36:38,132
Ali, bugun maosh kuni ekan-ku.

648
00:36:38,156 --> 00:36:41,489
Ha, maosh kuni.

649
00:36:41,512 --> 00:36:44,312
Juda kutgandayman.

650
00:36:44,335 --> 00:36:47,585
Hisobingizni tekshirib koʻrdingizmi?

651
00:36:47,609 --> 00:36:50,942
Ha, tekshirib koʻrdim.

652
00:36:50,965 --> 00:36:53,532
Pul tushibdi.

653
00:36:53,555 --> 00:36:56,088
Yaxshi bo'ldi, shundaymi?

654
00:36:56,111 --> 00:36:59,445
Bu mehnatingizning mukofoti.

655
00:36:59,468 --> 00:37:03,104
Ha. Juda xursandman.

656
00:37:03,128 --> 00:37:07,378
Birinchi ish haqi bilan nima qilmoqchisiz?

657
00:37:07,402 --> 00:37:11,402
Ota-onamga sovg'a sotib olaman.

658
00:37:11,425 --> 00:37:14,558
Malayziyadagi oilamga yuboraman.

659
00:37:14,581 --> 00:37:17,314
Bu juda yaxshi.

660
00:37:17,337 --> 00:37:20,704
Oilangiz xursand bo‘ladi-ku.

661
00:37:20,727 --> 00:37:24,093
Ha. Ular ham xursand bo‘lishadi deb o‘ylayman.

662
00:37:24,116 --> 00:37:28,370
O‘zingiz uchun ham biror narsa olmayapsizmi?

663
00:37:28,394 --> 00:37:30,194
Ha, shunday.

664
00:37:30,217 --> 00:37:34,183
Yaponiyaning yangi kiyimlarini xohlayman.

665
00:37:34,206 --> 00:37:36,240
Kiyimmi?

666
00:37:36,263 --> 00:37:38,349
Yaxshi ekan.

667
00:37:38,373 --> 00:37:42,252
Ha. Dam olish kunida borib sotib olaman.

668
00:37:42,276 --> 00:37:45,476
Bu mehnatingiz uchun mukofot.

669
00:37:45,499 --> 00:37:48,432
Ha. Mukofot.

670
00:37:48,455 --> 00:37:51,954
Keyingi ishni ham yaxshi bajaramiz.

671
00:37:51,978 --> 00:37:56,111
Ha. Keyingi ishni ham yaxshi bajaraman.

672
00:37:56,134 --> 00:38:00,068
Ali, siz endi do‘konning muhim xodimisiz.

673
00:38:00,090 --> 00:38:02,327
Ha. Rahmat.

674
00:38:02,350 --> 00:38:05,566
Kelajakda ham yaxshi hamkorlik qilamiz.

675
00:38:05,589 --> 00:38:09,806
Ha. Kelajakda ham yaxshi hamkorlik qilamiz.

676
00:38:09,830 --> 00:38:13,796
Ish haqi, juda xursandman.

677
00:38:13,819 --> 00:38:15,319
19-Sahna: Qaytimdagi xato / Handling Change Mistakes

678
00:38:15,319 --> 00:38:18,353
Ali, uzr so‘rayman.

679
00:38:18,375 --> 00:38:22,056
Qaytimi noto‘g‘ri berib qo‘ydim.

680
00:38:22,080 --> 00:38:25,214
Ha. Nima bo‘ldi?

681
00:38:25,237 --> 00:38:30,403
Mijozga 100 yen ortiq berib qo‘ydim.

682
00:38:30,426 --> 00:38:33,305
Bu juda yomon ekan.

683
00:38:33,329 --> 00:38:36,804
Kassadagi pul to‘g‘ri kelayapti-mi?

684
00:38:36,827 --> 00:38:40,594
Yo‘q, 100 yen yetmayapti.

685
00:38:40,617 --> 00:38:43,850
Men do‘kon mudiriga xabar beraman.

686
00:38:43,873 --> 00:38:47,540
Uzr. Rahmat.

687
00:38:47,563 --> 00:38:50,622
Mijoz hali shu yerda-mi?

688
00:38:50,645 --> 00:38:54,462
Yo‘q, allaqachon ketdi.

689
00:38:54,486 --> 00:38:56,552
Afsus.

690
00:38:56,575 --> 00:39:00,545
Lekin, xato har kimdan bo‘ladi.

691
00:39:00,569 --> 00:39:03,585
Ha, e'tibor beraman.

692
00:39:03,609 --> 00:39:06,942
Men ham avval ko‘p xatolar qilar edim.

693
00:39:06,965 --> 00:39:08,774
Rostdanmi?

694
00:39:08,798 --> 00:39:11,216
Yaxshi boʻldi, xotirjam boʻldim.

695
00:39:11,239 --> 00:39:15,173
Keyinroq sekin tekshirib ko‘ramiz.

696
00:39:15,196 --> 00:39:18,612
Ha. Sekin tekshiraman.

697
00:39:18,635 --> 00:39:22,401
Kassadagi summani yana bir bor ko‘rib chiqamiz.

698
00:39:22,424 --> 00:39:25,430
Ha. Birga ko‘ramiz.

699
00:39:25,454 --> 00:39:29,454
Xatolarni tezda tuzatish muhim.

700
00:39:29,476 --> 00:39:32,410
Ha. Tez tuzataman.

701
00:39:32,433 --> 00:39:34,599
Buni o‘ylab yurma.

702
00:39:34,622 --> 00:39:36,189
Rahmat.

703
00:39:36,212 --> 00:39:39,845
Ha. Kelajakda ham e’tibor beramiz.

704
00:39:39,868 --> 00:39:41,802
Ha. Rahmat.

705
00:39:41,825 --> 00:39:44,491
Yana yaxshi ishlaymiz.

706
00:39:44,514 --> 00:39:46,014
20-Sahna: Mikroto‘lqinli pechdagi xato / A Lesson on Microwave Mishaps

707
00:39:46,014 --> 00:39:52,449
Ali, tushlikni mikroto‘lqinli pechda isitdim, lekin xato chiqdi.

708
00:39:52,473 --> 00:39:56,040
Ҳа. Нима бўлди?

709
00:39:56,063 --> 00:40:01,430
Узоқ вақт иситиб юборганим учун идиш эриб кетди.

710
00:40:01,453 --> 00:40:04,546
Ой, бу қандай ямон бўлди-да!

711
00:40:04,569 --> 00:40:08,261
Мижоз газабланганмиди?

712
00:40:08,284 --> 00:40:13,919
Йўқ, газабланмаган, лекин узримиз кечади.

713
00:40:13,943 --> 00:40:18,201
Мен янги бентўртга алмаштириб бераман.

714
00:40:18,224 --> 00:40:19,918
Rahmat.

715
00:40:19,942 --> 00:40:22,013
Кечирасиз.

716
00:40:22,036 --> 00:40:25,803
Микротўлқинли печ вақти тўғрими?

717
00:40:25,827 --> 00:40:29,960
Ҳа. Қопда вақти ёзилган.

718
00:40:29,983 --> 00:40:33,150
Бундан кейин яхши кўрамиз.

719
00:40:33,173 --> 00:40:36,251
Ҳа. Яхши кўринг.

720
00:40:36,275 --> 00:40:40,133
Микротўлқинли печ жуда иссиқ бўлади.

721
00:40:40,156 --> 00:40:43,756
Ҳа. Жуда иссиқ.

722
00:40:43,779 --> 00:40:46,579
Кўйишдан сақланинг.

723
00:40:46,602 --> 00:40:50,369
Ҳа. Эхтиёт қилиб ишлайман.

724
00:40:50,392 --> 00:40:53,480
Бентўртгаси яхшими?

725
00:40:53,503 --> 00:40:57,636
Ҳа. Янги бентўртга бор.

726
00:40:57,659 --> 00:40:59,718
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

727
00:40:59,742 --> 00:41:02,875
Мижоздан узр сўраймиз.

728
00:41:02,898 --> 00:41:05,665
Ҳа. Узр сўрайман.

729
00:41:05,688 --> 00:41:09,254
Мижоз меҳрибон инсон эдими?

730
00:41:09,277 --> 00:41:12,644
Ҳа. Меҳрибон инсон эди.

731
00:41:12,667 --> 00:41:15,500
Ундай бўлса, кўнгил қуйди.

732
00:41:15,523 --> 00:41:18,591
Ҳа. Кўнгил қуйдим.

733
00:41:18,615 --> 00:41:21,418
Бундан кейин хатолик қилмаймиз.

734
00:41:21,441 --> 00:41:24,724
Ҳа. Кўп ҳаракат қиламиз.

735
00:41:24,747 --> 00:41:27,680
Биргаликда текширамиз.

736
00:41:27,703 --> 00:41:30,639
Ha. Rahmat.

737
00:41:30,663 --> 00:41:32,163
21-сахна: Мижозлар билан муомала машғулоти

738
00:41:32,163 --> 00:41:37,844
Алижон, ана ўша мижоз совуқ ичимлик излаяпти.

739
00:41:37,868 --> 00:41:42,083
Ҳа. Қандай ичимлик яхши бўлади?

740
00:41:42,106 --> 00:41:46,440
Чойми ёки шарбатми, деб сўранг.

741
00:41:46,463 --> 00:41:49,359
Ҳа. Сўраб келаман.

742
00:41:49,382 --> 00:41:53,230
Мижоз, чойми ёқтиради?

743
00:41:53,254 --> 00:41:56,388
Ёки шарбатми?

744
00:41:56,411 --> 00:42:00,744
Мижоз кўк чой яхши, деди.

745
00:42:00,767 --> 00:42:02,740
Tushunarli.

746
00:42:02,763 --> 00:42:06,302
Совуқ кўк чой шу ерда.

747
00:42:06,325 --> 00:42:09,801
Биргаликда йўл кўрсатиб беринг.

748
00:42:09,825 --> 00:42:12,758
Ҳа. Бу ердан, илтимос.

749
00:42:12,781 --> 00:42:16,026
Бу кўк чой жуда оммабоп.

750
00:42:16,050 --> 00:42:19,301
Жуда хўп ва одобли йўл кўрсатдингиз.

751
00:42:19,324 --> 00:42:21,257
Rahmat.

752
00:42:21,280 --> 00:42:24,914
Мижоз хурсанд бўлди.

753
00:42:24,937 --> 00:42:27,748
Бу яхши бўлди-да.

754
00:42:27,771 --> 00:42:32,738
Кейин газирланган ичимликлар жойини кўрсатиб қўying.

755
00:42:32,761 --> 00:42:37,604
Ҳа. Газирланган ичимликлар ҳам жуда оммабоп.

756
00:42:37,628 --> 00:42:42,637
Ҳа. Кола ва лимонад шу ердаги javonda.

757
00:42:42,660 --> 00:42:45,994
Ҳа. Шу ерда экан.

758
00:42:46,017 --> 00:42:49,704
Кола энг паст полкада.

759
00:42:49,727 --> 00:42:52,337
Жуда яхши биласиз-ку!

760
00:42:52,361 --> 00:42:56,937
Ҳа. Хар куни товарларни чиқараман.

761
00:42:56,960 --> 00:42:59,227
Аъло бўлди!

762
00:42:59,251 --> 00:43:01,146
Rahmat.

763
00:43:01,169 --> 00:43:04,936
Чойлар javonini ҳам тоза қилиб қўying.

764
00:43:04,959 --> 00:43:08,193
Ҳа. Тоза қилиб жойлаб қўяман.

765
00:43:08,216 --> 00:43:11,390
Ali aka juda gʻayratli ekansiz.

766
00:43:11,413 --> 00:43:15,429
Ha. Bu doʻkondan juda xursandman.

767
00:43:15,453 --> 00:43:16,953
Sahna 22: Yoʻqolgan hamyonni qidirishda yordam / Yoʻqolgan hamyonni topishga yordam berish

768
00:43:16,953 --> 00:43:20,219
Mijoz, nima boʻldi?

769
00:43:20,242 --> 00:43:21,809
Кечирасиз.

770
00:43:21,832 --> 00:43:24,865
Hamyonimni yoʻqotib qoʻydim.

771
00:43:24,888 --> 00:43:27,688
Bu yerda xarid qildingizmi?

772
00:43:27,711 --> 00:43:30,603
Yoʻq, hali emas.

773
00:43:30,627 --> 00:43:34,193
Doʻkonga kirishdan oldin tushirib qoʻygan boʻlishim mumkin.

774
00:43:34,216 --> 00:43:36,883
Qayerda yurdingiz?

775
00:43:36,907 --> 00:43:40,140
Bu doʻkon oldidagi yoʻlda yurgan edim.

776
00:43:40,163 --> 00:43:42,530
Birga qidiramiz.

777
00:43:42,553 --> 00:43:44,130
Rahmat.

778
00:43:44,153 --> 00:43:47,153
Guldon atrofini koʻrdingizmi?

779
00:43:47,176 --> 00:43:50,254
Koʻrdim, lekin yoʻq edi.

780
00:43:50,278 --> 00:43:52,944
U yerda, burchakda qanday?

781
00:43:52,967 --> 00:43:56,901
A, u yerda bir narsa bor.

782
00:43:56,924 --> 00:43:59,169
Bu hamyonmi?

783
00:43:59,193 --> 00:44:02,832
Ha, bu mening hamyonim.

784
00:44:02,855 --> 00:44:05,022
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

785
00:44:05,045 --> 00:44:07,611
Rostdan ham yaxshi boʻldi.

786
00:44:07,634 --> 00:44:10,111
Ichidagi narsalar joyidami?

787
00:44:10,135 --> 00:44:13,581
Ha, hammasi joyida.

788
00:44:13,605 --> 00:44:15,495
Yaxshi boʻldi, xotirjam boʻldim.

789
00:44:15,518 --> 00:44:18,284
Rostdan ham koʻp rahmat.

790
00:44:18,307 --> 00:44:20,759
Bu juda mehribon doʻkon ekan.

791
00:44:20,783 --> 00:44:23,616
Yoʻq, yaxshi boʻldi.

792
00:44:23,639 --> 00:44:26,672
Ehtiyot boʻlib uyga boring.

793
00:44:26,695 --> 00:44:29,552
Ha. Rahmat.

794
00:44:29,576 --> 00:44:32,509
Xarid qilasizmi?

795
00:44:32,532 --> 00:44:35,627
Ha, suv sotib olaman.

796
00:44:35,651 --> 00:44:37,785
Ha, marhamat.

797
00:44:37,808 --> 00:44:39,308
Sahna 23: Yangi xodimni oʻqitish / Yangi xodimni tayyorlash

798
00:44:39,308 --> 00:44:43,908
Ali aka, bugundan yangi xodim keladi.

799
00:44:43,931 --> 00:44:45,208
Ha.

800
00:44:45,232 --> 00:44:47,168
Erkakmi?

801
00:44:47,192 --> 00:44:48,858
Ayolmi?

802
00:44:48,881 --> 00:44:51,815
Yaponiyalik talaba.

803
00:44:51,838 --> 00:44:55,438
Ali aka, siz unga ishni oʻrgatib qoʻying.

804
00:44:55,461 --> 00:44:57,061
Ha.

805
00:44:57,084 --> 00:44:59,650
Men oʻrgataman.

806
00:44:59,673 --> 00:45:04,317
U birinchi marta, shuning uchun muloyim oʻrgating.

807
00:45:04,341 --> 00:45:05,979
Ha.

808
00:45:06,002 --> 00:45:08,569
Muloyim oʻrgataman.

809
00:45:08,592 --> 00:45:09,880
Salom.

810
00:45:09,904 --> 00:45:12,270
Men Ali.

811
00:45:12,293 --> 00:45:14,983
Bu Ken-san.

812
00:45:15,007 --> 00:45:20,423
Ken-san, Ali akadan kassa ishlatishni oʻrganing.

813
00:45:20,446 --> 00:45:22,688
Salom, Ken-san.

814
00:45:22,711 --> 00:45:26,511
Kassa ishlatish qiyin emas.

815
00:45:26,534 --> 00:45:29,067
Ali aka, iltimos.

816
00:45:29,090 --> 00:45:30,929
Ha.

817
00:45:30,953 --> 00:45:33,192
Avvalo, bu yerini bosing.

818
00:45:33,215 --> 00:45:36,282
Ken-san, tushundingizmi?

819
00:45:36,305 --> 00:45:39,338
Ken-san, bu yerga qarang.

820
00:45:39,361 --> 00:45:42,361
Shtrix-kodni shu yerda skanerlash kerak.

821
00:45:42,384 --> 00:45:46,237
Ali aka, sizning tushuntirishingiz juda aniq ekan.

822
00:45:46,261 --> 00:45:47,961
Rahmat.

823
00:45:47,984 --> 00:45:50,865
Asta-sekin oʻrganib olasiz.

824
00:45:50,889 --> 00:45:54,302
Ken-san, omad tilayman!

825
00:45:54,325 --> 00:45:55,665
Ha.

826
00:45:55,689 --> 00:45:58,135
Birga harakat qilamiz!

827
00:45:58,158 --> 00:46:01,825
Agar biror narsa boʻlsa, menga ayting.

828
00:46:01,848 --> 00:46:03,581
Ha.

829
00:46:03,604 --> 00:46:05,683
Чaqirib qo'yishim mumkin.

830
00:46:05,706 --> 00:46:09,040
Ali aka endi bizning ustozimiz.

831
00:46:09,062 --> 00:46:10,829
Ha.

832
00:46:10,852 --> 00:46:13,485
Ustoz sifatida harakat qilaman.

833
00:46:13,508 --> 00:46:15,008
Sahna 24: Yomgʻirli kunlardagi xizmat / Mijozlarga yomgʻirli kunlarda xizmat koʻrsatish

834
00:46:15,008 --> 00:46:19,242
Ali aka, yomgʻir yogʻayapti-ku.

835
00:46:19,265 --> 00:46:23,708
Ha. Tashqarida juda kuchli yomgʻir yogʻyapti.

836
00:46:23,731 --> 00:46:27,098
Yomgʻirli kunlar uchun maxsus xizmatlarimiz bor.

837
00:46:27,121 --> 00:46:30,921
Ha. Qanday xizmatlar?

838
00:46:30,944 --> 00:46:35,477
Kirish joyiga plastik soyabonlar tayyorlang.

839
00:46:35,500 --> 00:46:39,870
Ha. Plastik soyabonlarni tayyorlayman.

840
00:46:39,894 --> 00:46:45,060
Yomgʻirli kunlarda mijozlar soyabon olib kelishadi.

841
00:46:45,083 --> 00:46:49,138
Ha. Soyabon xaltachalari kerak boʻladi.

842
00:46:49,162 --> 00:46:51,563
Ha, shunday.

843
00:46:51,586 --> 00:46:54,881
Soyabon xaltachalarini kirish joyiga qoʻying.

844
00:46:54,905 --> 00:46:57,483
Ha. Qoʻydim.

845
00:46:57,506 --> 00:47:00,563
Mijozlar hoʻl boʻlib ketmasligi uchun harakat qilamiz.

846
00:47:00,586 --> 00:47:02,645
Rahmat.

847
00:47:02,669 --> 00:47:07,235
Shuningdek, kirish joyi silliq boʻlib qoladi.

848
00:47:07,258 --> 00:47:10,991
Ha. Polni tozalayman.

849
00:47:11,014 --> 00:47:14,508
Silliqmasligi uchun ehtiyot boʻling.

850
00:47:14,532 --> 00:47:17,499
Ha. Ehtiyot boʻlaman.

851
00:47:17,522 --> 00:47:22,089
Yomgʻirli kunlarda mijozlar kam boʻlishi mumkin.

852
00:47:22,112 --> 00:47:27,005
Ha. Lekin nonlarni toʻldirib turamiz.

853
00:47:27,028 --> 00:47:28,995
Yaxshi.

854
00:47:29,018 --> 00:47:33,426
Yomgʻirli kunlarda iliq ichimliklar koʻproq sotiladi.

855
00:47:33,450 --> 00:47:36,934
Ha. Koʻp miqdorda tayyorlaymiz.

856
00:47:36,958 --> 00:47:40,958
Ali aka, siz juda diqqatlisiz.

857
00:47:40,981 --> 00:47:43,865
Ha. Xursand boʻldim.

858
00:47:43,888 --> 00:47:46,422
Yomgʻir toʻxtasa yaxshi boʻlardi.

859
00:47:46,445 --> 00:47:49,855
Ha. Toʻxtasa yaxshi boʻlardi.

860
00:47:49,878 --> 00:47:51,645
Kuch-quvvat bilan harakat qilaylik.

861
00:47:51,668 --> 00:47:54,744
Ha. Harakat qilamiz.

862
00:47:54,768 --> 00:47:56,268
Sahna 25: Kassa ishlatish asoslari / Kassa apparatini ishlatish asoslari

863
00:47:56,268 --> 00:48:00,601
Ali aka, bugun juda band boʻldingiz-ku.

864
00:48:00,624 --> 00:48:06,643
Ha. Tushlik tanaffus vaqtida mijozlar koʻp boʻladi.

865
00:48:06,666 --> 00:48:10,684
Koʻp mijozlar tushlik ovqatlarini xarid qilmoqda.

866
00:48:10,708 --> 00:48:15,241
Ha. Ketma-ket hisob-kitob qilamiz.

867
00:48:15,264 --> 00:48:19,161
Shoshilmang, ehtiyotkorlik bilan bajaring.

868
00:48:19,185 --> 00:48:22,643
Ha. Ehtiyotkorlik bilan qilaman.

869
00:48:22,666 --> 00:48:26,099
Qaytimni xato bermaslikka harakat qiling.

870
00:48:26,122 --> 00:48:29,797
Ha. Qaytimni tekshirib turaman.

871
00:48:29,821 --> 00:48:33,255
Keyin isitamizmi?

872
00:48:33,278 --> 00:48:35,495
деб сўрайсиз.

873
00:48:35,518 --> 00:48:38,285
Ha. Isitamizmi?

874
00:48:38,308 --> 00:48:39,980
деб сўрайсиз.

875
00:48:40,003 --> 00:48:43,006
Xashaklarni ham unutmang.

876
00:48:43,029 --> 00:48:46,563
Ha. Xashaklarni ham qoʻshaman.

877
00:48:46,586 --> 00:48:49,352
Kassani tezroq bajarib boring.

878
00:48:49,375 --> 00:48:52,226
Ha. Harakat qilamiz.

879
00:48:52,250 --> 00:48:55,746
“Kechikib qoldirdik”, deb ayting.

880
00:48:55,770 --> 00:48:57,904
Kechikib qoldirdik.

881
00:48:57,927 --> 00:49:00,660
Juda yaxshi ovoz chiqardingiz.

882
00:49:00,683 --> 00:49:02,320
Rahmat.

883
00:49:02,344 --> 00:49:06,918
Band vaqt tugashiga oz qoldi.

884
00:49:06,941 --> 00:49:10,075
Ha. Harakat qilamiz.

885
00:49:10,098 --> 00:49:15,264
Band vaqtlarda hamkorlar bilan hamkorlik qilish eng yaxshisi.

886
00:49:15,287 --> 00:49:18,121
Ha. Hamkorlik qilamiz.

887
00:49:18,144 --> 00:49:20,311
Charchadingizmi?

888
00:49:20,334 --> 00:49:23,378
Yo'q, muammo yo'q.

889
00:49:23,402 --> 00:49:26,048
Tugatsak, tanaffus qilaylik.

890
00:49:26,071 --> 00:49:29,139
Ha, tanaffus qilamiz.

891
00:49:29,162 --> 00:49:30,662
26-Sahna: Yo'l ko'rsatish mashqi / Yapon tilida yo'nalishlarni mashq qilish

892
00:49:30,662 --> 00:49:34,662
Mijoz stansiya qayerda ekanini so'rayapti.

893
00:49:34,685 --> 00:49:36,923
deb so'rayapti.

894
00:49:36,946 --> 00:49:40,199
Ha, stansiya, shundaymi?

895
00:49:40,223 --> 00:49:44,189
Bu burchakdan o'ngga buriling.

896
00:49:44,212 --> 00:49:48,419
Keyin yo'l bormi?

897
00:49:48,443 --> 00:49:53,179
Keyin to'g'ri yuring.

898
00:49:53,203 --> 00:49:55,483
Uzoqmi?

899
00:49:55,506 --> 00:49:59,174
Yo'q, besh daqiqa atrofida.

900
00:49:59,198 --> 00:50:02,631
Rahmat, deb aytmoqda.

901
00:50:02,654 --> 00:50:06,988
Arzimaydi, xush kelibsiz.

902
00:50:07,011 --> 00:50:11,144
Ali, siz yo'l ko'rsatishda ham zo'r ekansiz!

903
00:50:11,167 --> 00:50:15,384
Ha, xaritani ko'rib oldim.

904
00:50:15,408 --> 00:50:19,057
Mijoz xursand bo'ldi-ku.

905
00:50:19,080 --> 00:50:22,413
Ha, yaxshi bo'ldi.

906
00:50:22,436 --> 00:50:26,408
Yapon tilida yo'l ko'rsatish qiyin bo'ladi, shundaymi?

907
00:50:26,432 --> 00:50:32,515
Ha, biroz qiyin, lekin xursandman.

908
00:50:32,538 --> 00:50:35,272
Foydali bo'ldi-ku.

909
00:50:35,295 --> 00:50:38,828
Ha, foydali bo'ldi.

910
00:50:38,851 --> 00:50:44,097
Bu yaqinlarda boshqa sayyohlik joylari bormi?

911
00:50:44,120 --> 00:50:49,320
Ha, u yerda katta bog' bor.

912
00:50:49,343 --> 00:50:53,576
Shundaymi, sayr qilish uchun yaxshi joy ekan.

913
00:50:53,599 --> 00:50:56,877
Ha, juda yaxshi joy.

914
00:50:56,900 --> 00:51:01,542
Ali tufayli mijoz ham xotirjam bo'ldi.

915
00:51:01,566 --> 00:51:04,541
Ha, yaxshi bo'ldi.

916
00:51:04,564 --> 00:51:07,697
Kelajakda ham shunday qilib turing.

917
00:51:07,720 --> 00:51:10,854
Ha. Harakat qilamiz.

918
00:51:10,877 --> 00:51:12,377
27-Sahna: Tanaffusdagi suhbat / Tanaffus vaqtidagi suhbatlar

919
00:51:12,377 --> 00:51:16,636
Ali, tanaffus vaqti keldi-ku.

920
00:51:16,659 --> 00:51:19,459
Ha, rahmat.

921
00:51:19,482 --> 00:51:21,915
Nima yeysiz?

922
00:51:21,938 --> 00:51:25,705
Men onigiri yeyman.

923
00:51:25,728 --> 00:51:29,494
Men sendvich yeyman.

924
00:51:29,517 --> 00:51:33,451
Tanaffusda odatda nima qilasiz?

925
00:51:33,474 --> 00:51:37,607
Men ko'pincha musiqa tinglayman.

926
00:51:37,630 --> 00:51:40,397
Yapon musiqasimi?

927
00:51:40,420 --> 00:51:45,020
Ha, yaqinda yapon pop musiqasini yoqtirib qoldim.

928
00:51:45,043 --> 00:51:47,921
Kimning musiqasini yoqtirasiz?

929
00:51:47,945 --> 00:51:52,145
Men YOASOBI ni yoqtiraman.

930
00:51:52,168 --> 00:51:54,343
Men ham yoqtiraman.

931
00:51:54,366 --> 00:51:57,299
Juda mashhur, shundaymi?

932
00:51:57,322 --> 00:52:01,189
Ha, qo'shiq so'zlari juda qiziqarli.

933
00:52:01,212 --> 00:52:04,745
Malayziya musiqasini ham tinglaymisiz?

934
00:52:04,768 --> 00:52:09,337
Ha, Malayziya qo'shiqlari ham ajoyib.

935
00:52:09,361 --> 00:52:11,761
Keyinroq menga ham aytib bering.

936
00:52:11,784 --> 00:52:15,384
Ha, albatta tinglang.

937
00:52:15,407 --> 00:52:20,440
Tanaffus qisqa bo'lsa-da, muhim.

938
00:52:20,463 --> 00:52:23,796
Ha, kayfiyatni yangilash mumkin.

939
00:52:23,819 --> 00:52:27,264
Tushdan keyin ham ishni davom ettiramiz.

940
00:52:27,288 --> 00:52:30,098
Ha, harakat qilaman.

941
00:52:30,122 --> 00:52:34,539
Tanaffus tugagach, kassani o'zgartirib olamiz.

942
00:52:34,562 --> 00:52:36,563
Ha, iltimos.

943
00:52:36,586 --> 00:52:39,237
Yangilanib oldim.

944
00:52:39,261 --> 00:52:40,761
28-Sahna: Yopilish tayyorligi / Yopilish vaqti tayyorligi

945
00:52:40,761 --> 00:52:45,213
Ali aka, endi ketish vaqti keldi-ku.

946
00:52:45,237 --> 00:52:48,525
Ha. Soat toʻqqiz boʻldi.

947
00:52:48,548 --> 00:52:51,044
Bugun uchun rahmat.

948
00:52:51,067 --> 00:52:54,242
Ha. Charchadingizmi?

949
00:52:54,265 --> 00:52:57,532
Kassadagi pulni tekshirib chiqaylik.

950
00:52:57,555 --> 00:53:00,788
Ha. Sanab koʻraylik.

951
00:53:00,811 --> 00:53:03,544
Naqd pul toʻgʻrimi?

952
00:53:03,567 --> 00:53:06,457
Ha. Toʻgʻri kelmoqda.

953
00:53:06,481 --> 00:53:08,548
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

954
00:53:08,571 --> 00:53:11,772
Tozalash ham mukammal ekan.

955
00:53:11,795 --> 00:53:15,363
Ha. Tozalash ham tugadi.

956
00:53:15,387 --> 00:53:18,605
Axlatni ham tashladingizmi?

957
00:53:18,629 --> 00:53:21,232
Ha. Tashladim.

958
00:53:21,255 --> 00:53:22,937
Rahmat.

959
00:53:22,961 --> 00:53:26,094
Sizga ishonish mumkin ekan.

960
00:53:26,117 --> 00:53:29,129
Yoʻq, oddiy hol.

961
00:53:29,153 --> 00:53:31,772
Keyingi safar indinga emas, bir kun keyin ekan-ku.

962
00:53:31,796 --> 00:53:35,164
Ha. Indinga.

963
00:53:35,187 --> 00:53:38,020
Yana kelishingizni kutamiz.

964
00:53:38,043 --> 00:53:41,294
Ha. Kutib qolamiz.

965
00:53:41,318 --> 00:53:44,085
Men oldinroq ketaman.

966
00:53:44,108 --> 00:53:46,475
Xayr, charchingizni oling.

967
00:53:46,498 --> 00:53:48,866
Xayr, charchingizni oling.

968
00:53:48,889 --> 00:53:51,456
Ehtiyot boʻling, ketishda.

969
00:53:51,479 --> 00:53:55,358
Ha. Ehtiyot boʻlaman.

970
00:53:55,381 --> 00:53:57,874
Indinga yana kelaman.

971
00:53:57,898 --> 00:54:00,931
Ha. Indinga koʻrishamiz.

972
00:54:00,954 --> 00:54:02,887
Kechirasiz.

973
00:54:02,910 --> 00:54:04,410
29-Sahna: Alining oʻsishi va taraqqiyoti / Alining oʻsishi

974
00:54:04,410 --> 00:54:09,544
Ali aka, soʻnggi vaqtlarda juda yaxshi ishlayapsiz.

975
00:54:09,567 --> 00:54:11,900
Ha, rahmat.

976
00:54:11,923 --> 00:54:15,723
Dastlab juda asabiylashgan edingiz-ku.

977
00:54:15,746 --> 00:54:19,479
Ha, rostdan ham asabiylashgan edim.

978
00:54:19,502 --> 00:54:22,836
Endi esa allaqachon ustozdek koʻrinip qoldingiz.

979
00:54:22,859 --> 00:54:26,792
Ha, ish endi qiziqarli boʻldi.

980
00:54:26,815 --> 00:54:30,433
Mijozlar bilan ham yaxshi gaplashasiz-ku.

981
00:54:30,456 --> 00:54:34,509
Ha, doimiy mijozlarim ham boʻldi.

982
00:54:34,533 --> 00:54:36,984
Bu juda ajoyib.

983
00:54:37,007 --> 00:54:40,341
Yapon tilini ham juda tabiiy gapira boshladingiz.

984
00:54:40,364 --> 00:54:42,179
Rahmat.

985
00:54:42,202 --> 00:54:44,484
Bu doʻkon mudiri tufayli.

986
00:54:44,507 --> 00:54:48,323
Yoʻq, bu Alining oʻz mehnati.

987
00:54:48,347 --> 00:54:50,757
Rostdan ham xursandman.

988
00:54:50,780 --> 00:54:53,647
Shu tarzda davom eting.

989
00:54:53,670 --> 00:54:56,805
Ha, yanada harakat qilaman.

990
00:54:56,828 --> 00:55:00,028
Qandaydir muammo bormi?

991
00:55:00,051 --> 00:55:03,668
Yoʻq, hozircha yoʻq.

992
00:55:03,692 --> 00:55:06,825
Har qanday vaqtda maslahat soʻrashingiz mumkin.

993
00:55:06,848 --> 00:55:09,648
Ha, maslahat soʻrayman.

994
00:55:09,671 --> 00:55:13,004
Alining oʻsishini kuzatish juda qiziqarli boʻladi.

995
00:55:13,027 --> 00:55:16,394
Ha, men ham shu kunni kutaman.

996
00:55:16,417 --> 00:55:18,150
Rahmat.

997
00:55:18,173 --> 00:55:22,269
Ha, men ham sizga rahmat.

998
00:55:22,293 --> 00:55:23,793
30-Sahna: Vidolashuv va minnatdorchilik / Xayrlashuv va minnatdorchilik

999
00:55:23,793 --> 00:55:27,593
Ali aka, bugun oxirgi kun ekan-ku.

1000
00:55:27,616 --> 00:55:30,694
Ha, bugun oxirgi kun.

1001
00:55:30,718 --> 00:55:33,322
Juda ham xafa boʻldim.

1002
00:55:33,345 --> 00:55:37,312
Butun bir yil davomida, chin dildan raxmat.

1003
00:55:37,335 --> 00:55:40,747
Men ham sizga raxmat.

1004
00:55:40,770 --> 00:55:45,024
Ali, sizning borligingiz bizga juda yordam berdi.

1005
00:55:45,047 --> 00:55:47,014
Rahmat.

1006
00:55:47,037 --> 00:55:50,052
Bu yerda ishlaganimdan xursandman.

1007
00:55:50,075 --> 00:55:53,842
Ali, siz albatta yaxshi mutaxassis boʻlasiz.

1008
00:55:53,865 --> 00:55:56,432
Ha, harakat qilaman.

1009
00:55:56,455 --> 00:55:59,988
Doʻkon mudiri, sizga chin dildan minnatdorman.

1010
00:56:00,011 --> 00:56:04,645
Yaponiyadagi ish tajribangiz yaxshi boʻldimi?

1011
00:56:04,669 --> 00:56:07,902
Ha, umrim davomida unutmayman.

1012
00:56:07,925 --> 00:56:10,560
Haqiqatan ham ajoyib tajriba boʻldi.

1013
00:56:10,583 --> 00:56:14,550
Agar qiyinchilikka duch kelsangiz, istalgan vaqtda kelishingiz mumkin.

1014
00:56:14,573 --> 00:56:16,773
Ha, rahmat.

1015
00:56:16,796 --> 00:56:19,283
Oʻyin-kulgiga kelishim mumkinmi?

1016
00:56:19,307 --> 00:56:21,640
Albatta, kelishingiz mumkin.

1017
00:56:21,663 --> 00:56:23,930
Istalgan vaqtda kutib qolamiz.

1018
00:56:23,953 --> 00:56:27,199
Ha, albatta yana kelaman.

1019
00:56:27,223 --> 00:56:29,090
Xayr.

1020
00:56:29,114 --> 00:56:30,514
Xayr.

1021
00:56:30,537 --> 00:56:32,170
Salomat boʻling.

1022
00:56:32,193 --> 00:56:34,626
Ali, siz ham salomat boʻling.

1023
00:56:34,649 --> 00:56:36,541
Rahmat.

1024
00:56:36,565 --> 00:56:38,131
Rahmat.